<title>FINLAND: POSTIPANKKI CUTS PRIME RATE TO 4.50 PCT FROM 5.00.</title>
<headline>POSTIPANKKI CUTS PRIME RATE TO 4.50 PCT FROM 5.00.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish state-owned commercial bank Postipankki Oy said in a statement on Monday it would lower its prime rate to 4.50 percent from 5.00 percent effective October 1.</p>
<p>The lowering of the prime rate was based on the fall of shorter market interest rates and moderate inflation expectations, Postipankki said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom + 358 - 0 - 680 50 240</p>
</text>
